            </note>
            <note corresp="#d167-f2" n="6" xml:id="d167-f2-content">
                <p>The Chilean office responsible for administering import controls.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d167-f3" n="7" xml:id="d167-f3-content">
                <p>Leonard H. Price of the Office of Economic Warfare, successor agency to the Board
                    of Economic Warfare.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
